WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.600
Ryu falls from the slide prerequisite.

2
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.150
Kimberly advances during the knockdown.

3
00:00:01.150 --> 00:00:01.550
The retreat makes Ryu’s throw attempt whiff.

4
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.950
Standing heavy punch punishes the missed throw.

5
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:03.950
Sprint stop and standing heavy kick connect into the target route.

6
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:04.650
Sprint slide completes the punish.

7
00:00:04.650 --> 00:00:06.050
Ryu lands in knockdown.
